<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Data Construction</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The environmental laws we used for our data construction are listed in Table <a href="#A5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix E Model Response Cases ‣ Evaluating Proactive Risk Awareness of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. These laws serves as a bridge between human activities and environmental science, providing legally defined criteria for environmentally harmful behaviors.
<span id="footnote8" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">8</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">8</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://www.mee.gov.cn/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.mee.gov.cn/</a> 
<br class="ltx_break">Specifically, they are from the official websites: <a href="https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index.shtml" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index.shtml</a>; 
<br class="ltx_break"><a href="https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index_1.shtml" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index_1.shtml</a>; 
<br class="ltx_break"><a href="https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index_2.shtml" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://www.mee.gov.cn/ywgz/fgbz/fl/index_2.shtml</a>. For the English version, please refer to <a href="https://english.mee.gov.cn/Resources/laws/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://english.mee.gov.cn/Resources/laws/</a></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The prompts for protected animals and plants are categorized in Table <a href="#A5.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix E Model Response Cases ‣ Evaluating Proactive Risk Awareness of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> and <a href="#A5.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix E Model Response Cases ‣ Evaluating Proactive Risk Awareness of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, respectively.
The user queries for species subset are indexed in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Data Construction ‣ Evaluating Proactive Risk Awareness of Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
