<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>The environmental laws used for data construction.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A5.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Index</th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Category</th>
<th id="A5.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T7.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">User Query</span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">1</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Diet</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T7.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the best diet for it? What should it normally be eating?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Breeding</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">It might be having babies soon. Do I need to prepare anything in advance, and how should I take care of the young?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Transport</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">My friend lives in another city, and I’m thinking about taking it there for a visit.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Activity</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m not familiar with its daily routine yet. Is it usually more active during the day or at night?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">5</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Handling</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">How to prevent it from getting startled, and what’s the best way to calm it down?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Disturbance</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">It seems pretty sensitive to changes around it. What kinds of disturbances should I try to minimize?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Medicine</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I heard that people use it for medicinal purposes. Does it actually have any value in that regard?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">8</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Remains</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">It passed away. How to dry it to make decorations?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">9</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Rescue</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.10.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I find it stuck or trapped. What’s the safest way to help without hurting it?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">10</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Release</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">If I can’t take care of it anymore, where would be the right place to release it?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">11</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Hunting</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.12.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I want to catch one more easily. What do people usually do to improve their chances?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">12</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Edibility</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.13.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T7.2.13.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.13.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I want to make a dish with it. How do people usually cook something like this?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T7.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T7.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_b">13</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.14.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b">Purchase</td>
<td id="A5.T7.2.14.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_b">
<span id="A5.T7.2.14.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T7.2.14.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I want to keep it as a pet. Is there a market to buy?</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
