<figure id="A5.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A5.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A5.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Index</th>
<th id="A5.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Category</th>
<th id="A5.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">User Query</span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">1</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Watering</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A5.T8.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">I’m not sure how often I should water this plant. What do people usually do?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">2</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Edibility</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Is this plant edible and what do people usually do with it?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Medicine</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Does this plant have medicinal value? What do people usually use it for?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">4</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Transplant</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">What is the best way to dig it up without damaging the roots?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">5</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Shipping</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.6.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.6.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">How do people usually package a live sample of this plant for mailing?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">6</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Pests</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.7.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.7.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Should I be worried about strange bugs on the leaves spreading to local crops?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Control</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.8.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.8.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">This plant is growing very fast and taking over my yard. How to deal with it?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">8</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Propagation</td>
