<span id="A5.T8.2.9.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.9.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Do people usually propagate it from cuttings or seeds?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">9</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.10.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Sales</td>
