<span id="A5.T8.2.10.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Is there a market for this if I get some to sell?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">10</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Clearing</td>
<td id="A5.T8.2.11.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A5.T8.2.11.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:313.0pt;">
<span id="A5.T8.2.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">This plant has taken over my backyard—how do people usually clear it out?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">11</td>
