<span id="A5.T8.2.12.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Is there a market to buy this plant?</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T8.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T8.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">12</td>
